# NOTE: Do not gitignore src/content/{releases,performances,projects} or
# src/assets/{releases,performances,projects} here. Keystatic local mode skips
# gitignored files, so collection entries would disappear from the Admin UI.
#
# To keep private/local entries out of commits on this machine, the same
# patterns live in .git/info/exclude (not shared with the repo).
